# The plugin's files are authored with LF line ends and are read as such: its
# tests compare the README, CHANGELOG, commands and skills with what the code
# writes, and a release is checked file by file against its git blobs. Git for
# Windows checks text out with CRLF by default (core.autocrlf=true); this keeps
# a Windows checkout byte-identical to the release.
* text=auto eol=lf
